+ ```tabular

- column  Entity
- column  Character
+ column  Entidade
+ column  Caractere

- row  `&amp;`  `&`
+ row  `&amp;`  `&`

- row  `&lt;`  `<`
+ row  `&lt;`  `<`

- row  `&gt;`  `>`
+ row  `&gt;`  `>`

- row  `&quot;`  `"`
+ row  `&quot;`  `"`

- row  `&apos;`  `'`
+ row  `&apos;`  `'`

- row  `&#NNN;`, `&#xHHH;`  the character with that code point
+ row  `&#NNN;`, `&#xHHH;`  o caractere com esse codepoint

= row  `&#NNN;`, `&#xHHH;`  the character with that code point
